  "description": "This is the third planning application submitted for this site. We were not previously advised that there was insufficient information to determine the application. If any further amendments or clarification are required, please let us know and we will address them promptly.\n\nDescription of Development:\nRetrospective planning permission for the conversion of the existing dwellinghouse into 2 self-contained dwellings (1 x 1-bedroom and 1 x 2-bedroom unit), including associated refuse storage, cycle storage, and private amenity space.\n\nThe semi-detached property was originally a single dwelling owned by two siblings. The property benefitted from a loft conversion and a single-storey rear extension and was subsequently converted into two dwellings in February 2020. The works were completed in February 2020.\n\nThere are two other properties on the same road that have similarly been converted into two units. Refuse and recycling storage are located within the driveway, consistent with previously approved arrangements in the area.\n\nBoth dwellings benefit from separate private garden areas.\n\nWe would be grateful if you could confirm whether any further information or amendments are required to progress the application.\n\nKind regards,\nMansoor Amiri\nMM Architecture & Structure",
